window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"malphite","b":"locke","win":["Skill","Skill","Skill","Malphite","Skill","Malphite","Malphite"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 4-5","text":"Thunderclap armor plus Granite Shield blunt his Ritual Nails mark burst"},{"when":"1st item","text":"Armor core online — Silver Stake's on-hit chip stops out-trading you"},{"when":"2+ items","text":"Full armor wall — but his Purgatory grounds your R engage"}],"wants":{"you":["Ground Slam grounds Ashen Pursuit","Grievous Wounds to cut Soul Ignition","Fights past Soul Ignition's 18s window"],"foe":["Ritual Nails marks, then autos eat them","Purgatory grounding your R out of the engage","Dodging Q to starve your poke"]},"early":"The first three levels are a genuine skill lane: trade Seismic Shard for Ritual Nails (950 range, 10s at rank 1), step out to reset Granite Shield between exchanges, and do not burn mana racing him — neither of you forces a kill yet, so the winner is whoever banks more free chip and CS.","mid":"From 4-5 Thunderclap, armor points and Granite Shield blunt his burst, so chip with Seismic Shard every 8s. At 6 respect Purgatory (120s): it grounds, so it does not just execute you, it strips Unstoppable Force from your engage. Ult after his R. After first item you out-sustain Silver Stake's on-hit chip and the lane is yours.","late":"You out-scale him cleanly: stack armor, frontline every fight and force engagements around your R. His burst cannot race your tank stats down, so peel his dive attempts, keep your HP out of execute range, and lock him down for your team the moment he commits onto a carry.","whys":["Even opener — your Granite Shield and Q slow trade level with his mark poke; neither side has a kill.","Level 2 is still decided by spacing — your armor is not online yet, so whoever lands poke without eating a full trade back wins it.","Level 3 stays a pure poke duel — neither of you can kill the other, so it is Q chip against mark chip.","At 4-5 your W, first armor points and Granite Shield start blunting his burst — short trades tilt your way.","Level 6 evens out — Purgatory grounds, so his 120s ult can strip your engage before the execute is even relevant.","After first item your armor and shield out-sustain his on-hit mark poke — you win the war of attrition.","Late you are an armor wall with a fight-swinging R his burst simply cannot out-race."]});
