window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"malphite","b":"masteryi","win":["Malphite","Malphite","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1","text":"Seismic Shard plus Granite Shield win the opening trades"},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"R is a team engage — with jungle backup it still kills him"},{"when":"2+ items","text":"Highlander ignores slows, so Seismic Shard stops holding him"}],"wants":{"you":["Ground Slam grounds his Alpha Strike","Grievous Wounds on Meditate","Short trades before Wuju Style"],"foe":["Wuju Style's true damage in long trades","Highlander up: it ignores slows","Sidelane duels past level 4"]},"early":"Cash in while the lane is yours: Q him on every approach at level 1 and let Granite Shield eat the counter-trade for free. Through level 2 your E slow and early armor keep winning exchanges, but watch the mana bar — by 3 his Alpha Strike and Wuju true damage make it a genuine fight instead of a beating.","mid":"From 4-5 the lane flips hard: Wuju Style's true damage ignores your armor, so farm with Q and E and refuse extended trades. At 6 never coin-flip your R, and know Highlander (85s) makes him immune to slows — Seismic Shard will not hold him once it is on. Ground Slam grounds Alpha Strike — that is the button that stops him.","late":"Do not duel him — Wuju Style's true damage out-scales your armor however much you stack, and Meditate heals back what you land, so Grievous Wounds is not optional. Group, force 5v5s where your R swings the fight before he cleans up; your job is starting fights and soaking, not checking the Yi.","whys":["Your Q poke and Granite Shield win level 1 — chunk him on every approach and shrug off the trade back.","At 2 your E slow, early armor and shield still out-trade his young kit — keep the pressure on.","Level 3 turns skillful — Alpha Strike and Wuju true damage start answering your poke, and your mana runs thin.","By 4-5 Wuju Style's true damage cuts through armor and Alpha Strike goes untargetable mid-dash — stop taking extended trades.","At 6 he baits your R and all-ins the moment it is down — hold it or use it with backup, never as a solo coin-flip.","Once his attack speed is online his true damage out-DPSes your armor stacking — first item is his spike, not yours.","Late Highlander's slow immunity blanks Seismic Shard and Meditate heals back your chip — you are a teamfight ult."]});
